          },
          {
            "id": "c11",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 8,
            "y": 0,
            "w": 4,
            "h": 11,
            "text": "The inventory of each compartment, in becquerels, as the release works its way down the chain: out of the **repository**, through the **geosphere** and the **soil**, and into the **well**. The other tab has the dose in numbers.\n\nThe controls are on the first page. Every page reads the same run, so what they do shows here too.",
            "style": "note",
            "align": "left"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
